  "ai.orion81Builds": "Orion-81 imamangidwa pa mapulogalamu otsegula olembedwa ndi anthu. Alembedwa pano chifukwa sanapangidwe ndi AI.",
  "ai.orion81Completely": "<0>Orion-81 ndi ntchito yopangidwa kwathunthu ndi AI.<\/0> Mzere uliwonse wa khodi ya Orion-81 yokha unalembedwa ndi Claude Code, motsogozedwa ndi woyambitsa. Chombo chilichonse, mapu, mawonekedwe ndi mawu zinapangidwa ndi zida zomwe Claude Code inalemba. Woyambitsa amasankha zomwe zimangidwe; Claude Code imaganizira momwe zimangidwire. Malaibulale otsegula omwe imamangidwapo alembedwa pansipa pa 'Zosapangidwa ndi AI'. Chinthu chimodzi chikadali chotseguka ndipo chikuwonetsedwa poyera: <1>kuwunikidwa kwa chilolezo<\/1> cha khodi ya masewera yochokera ku chitsanzo choyamba cha GPL.",
  "ai.orionBegan28": "Orion inayamba pa 28 Seputembala 2026 ngati chitsanzo choyamba pa injini yotsegula ya Quake III Arena (GPL), ndi zombo za Elite Dangerous monga chilimbikitso chake. Pa tsiku lachiwiri khodi ya masewerawa inasamukira ku BuB, injini yatsopano yolembedwa ndi Claude Code; ma modyuli a masewera anachokera ku chitsanzo choyamba ndipo anasinthidwa mayina. Mtundu 0.3.0 unapatsa magulu onse 16 a zombo matupi atsopano awoawo. Kuwunika kutsatira malamulo a chilolezo kukuyang'ana ngati khodi ina ikadali yochokera ku GPL yoyambirira, komanso ngati mapangidwe oyambirira a zombo ali ofanana kwambiri ndi chilimbikitso chawo. Kuyesa kodziyendera kofanana kwa khodi ndi magwero a chitsanzo choyamba cha GPL kunachitika pa 8 Okutobala 2026, ndipo kuwunika kwa akatswiri pa zofanana zomwe zinapezeka kukuchitika. Chilichonse chochokera kwina chidzalembedwanso kapena kupangidwanso.",
