  "economy.todayHead": "Zomwe zilipo lero",
  "economy.todayLead": "Magulu a thupi ndi chishango ndi mitundu ya chishango ya chithunzi cha LOADOUT (0.6.0) amawonetsa mtundu wa kukweza ndi zokongoletsa zomwe chuma chikufuna kupereka.",
  "faq.becauseRevenueMeant": "Chifukwa ndalama zake zikuyenera kuwalipira. Masewerawa amayamba atapangidwa kwathunthu ndi AI kuti akhaleko konse; opanga zithunzi olipidwa kenako amalowa m'malo mwa ntchito ya AI, atatchulidwa mayina.",
  "faq.canIPlay": "Kodi ndingasewere pa intaneti?",
  "faq.freePlay": "Kodi kusewera ndi kwaulere?",
  "faq.n07Questions": "07 · Mafunso",
  "faq.notYetLan": "Sizinatheke. Kusewera pa LAN pa intaneti yomweyo kumagwira ntchito lero (kuyambira 0.2.0); kusewera pa intaneti sikunamangidwe.",
  "faq.prototypeWasBuilt": "Chitsanzo choyamba chinamangidwa pa injini yotsegula ya Quake III Arena (GPL) ndipo chinatenga zombo za Elite Dangerous ngati chilimbikitso. Pa tsiku lachiwiri khodi ya masewerawa inasamukira ku BuB, injini yatsopano yolembedwa ndi Claude Code; ma modyuli a masewera anachokera ku chitsanzo choyamba ndipo anasinthidwa mayina. Mtundu 0.3.0 unapatsa magulu onse 16 a zombo matupi atsopano. Kuwunika kutsatira malamulo a chilolezo kukuyang'ana ngati khodi ina ikadali yochokera ku GPL yoyambirira, komanso ngati mapangidwe oyambirira a zombo ali ofanana kwambiri ndi chilimbikitso chawo. Kuyesa kodziyendera kofanana kwa khodi ndi magwero a chitsanzo choyamba cha GPL kunachitika pa <0/>, ndipo kuwunika kwa akatswiri pa zofanana zomwe zinapezeka kukuchitika. Chilichonse chochokera kwina chidzalembedwanso kapena kupangidwanso. Kuwunikaku kusanathe, sitinena kuti yankho ndi ayi.",
  "faq.questions": "Mafunso",
  "faq.shipsArtInterface": "Zombo, zojambula, mawonekedwe ndi zina, ndalama zikalola. <0>Buku lomwe lili patsamba lino<\/0> limalemba chinthu chilichonse ndipo lidzawonetsa cholowa m'malo chilichonse ndi wopanga wake.",
  "faq.shipsUpgradesPlanned": "Zombo ndi kukweza zakonzedwa kuti zitha kupezeka mwa kusewera kapena kugulidwa. Momwe zombo zolipidwa zimakhalira zachilungamo pa masewera a wosewera motsutsana ndi wosewera zikukonzedwabe.",
  "faq.thatPlanFree": "Ndiyo ndondomeko: kusewera kwaulere ndi ndalama zamumasewera zosankha ndi zokongoletsa. Sizinamangidwe panobe.",
  "faq.wasAnyoneS": "Kodi ntchito ya wina inakopedwa?",
  "faq.whenOutWhat": "Idzatuluka liti, ndipo pa chiyani?",
  "faq.whichPartsWill": "Ndi zigawo ziti zomwe anthu adzalowa m'malo, ndipo ndidzadziwa bwanji?",
  "faq.whyWouldAi": "Chifukwa chiyani masewera opangidwa ndi AI angathandize opanga zithunzi?",
  "faq.willPayWin": "Kodi lidzakhala la kulipira kuti upambane?",
  "faq.windowsPcThere": "Windows PC. Palibe tsiku lotulutsa komanso mtengo panobe.",
  "footer.anthropicClaudeClaude": "Anthropic, Claude ndi Claude Code ndi zizindikiro za Anthropic, PBC. Unreal Engine ndi Epic Games ndi zizindikiro za Epic Games, Inc. Blender ndi chizindikiro cha Blender Foundation. Quake III Arena ndi Elite Dangerous ndi zizindikiro za eni ake. Mayina onse ndi a eni ake ndipo amagwiritsidwa ntchito kungozindikiritsa zinthu zotchulidwa. Orion-81 siyogwirizana, yothandizidwa kapena yovomerezedwa ndi aliyense wa iwo.",
  "footer.aspirationalNoPartnership": "Ya chiyembekezo. Palibe mgwirizano, ubale kapena kuvomereza komwe kulipo.",
  "footer.channelComing": "Channel ikubwera",
  "footer.devlogYoutube": "Devlog pa YouTube",
  "footer.followKickstarter": "Tsatirani Kickstarter",
  "footer.futurePartners": "Okhala nawo m'tsogolo?",
  "footer.noTrackersNo": "Palibe zotsata ogwiritsa. Palibe ma cookie. Tsamba lachitsanzo. Chowonadi chilichonse chimatsatiridwa ku malo osungira zakale a polojekiti; palibe chomwe chili pano ndi chopereka kapena lonjezo.",
  "footer.notLiveYet": "Sichinayambe",
  "footer.oneItemStill": "Chinthu chimodzi chikadali chotseguka: <0>kuwunika kwa chilolezo<\/0> cha khodi ya masewera yochokera ku chitsanzo choyamba cha GPL. Kuyesa kodziyendera kofanana kwa khodi ndi magwero a chitsanzo choyamba kunachitika pa <1/>, ndipo kuwunika kwa akatswiri pa zofanana zomwe zinapezeka kukuchitika.",
